<b>The Fire that Powered Lost Souls</b>

The flames of the <b>Dragon Talon</b> style are no ordinary fire. These are the <b>Dragon's Ember</b>—a mystical fire imbued with ancient magic harnessed over millennia. An ancient dragon with unparalleled mastery over fire was the first to bestow the Dragon's Ember upon Uzoth, granting him elemental power beyond measure.

The flames that come with this power was more than just a physical transformation; it was a spiritual awakening. The flames represented not only destruction and power, but also rebirth and purity. The flames of the Dragon Talon are grounded with magical properties. Practices of this art can learn to manipulate the flames into different shapes and forms, adapting to the will of the user. 

Harnessing the flames is no easy feat. One must undergo rigorous training and possess a heart of purity and resolve. One must learn to channel the fire within their soul, and merge it with the meridians throughout their bodily shell. This process requires immense discipline and focus, as the flames are as volatile as they are powerful. Through meditation and physical conditioning, students can learn to control the flames in any way they wish.
